		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2894&amp;p=37708#p37708"><![CDATA[
<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hello, greetings everyone, here I leave you my version 4 theme for OpenGD77 with color screens.<br>This version is set with different day and night color themes, both in one file...<br>To configure the automatic mode from day to night, it is done from the device by activating the Options / Display Options menu / In this menu, activate the option, "Auto night: On".<br>Switch between day mode and night mode<br>Pressing and holding the SK1 button and touching the red button switches between day mode and night mode.<br>Thanks to friend Daniel F1RMB. Thank you very much Daniel for all the work you are doing!<br>P.D. The SK1 button is the one above the PTT.<br><a href="https://youtu.be/Yn9oZGb9YiM" class="postlink">https://youtu.be/Yn9oZGb9YiM</a></div></blockquote>How can I view a simulation of the theme on the PC meanwhile modifying it, without needing to see it on the handy?<br><br>Edito que he visto que eres español: quiero decir, que como puedes ir viendo cómo va quedando la modificación del tema durante la marcha en el pc, sin necesidad de ir subiendo al walkie.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8875">EA7LIP</a> — Sun Jul 13, 2025 7:48 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
